.MARINE...
(Today through Tuesday)
Issued at 524 AM PDT Thu Aug 13 2026

Fresh to strong northwest winds slacken to moderate to fresh today
with rough seas becoming moderate by the evening. A long period
southerly swell will gradually increase Thursday reaching 16 to 18
seconds (possibly higher at times) by Friday and continuing
through the remainder of the weekend. Visibility may decrease due
to haze and smoke nearby the Big Sur coastline due to the Timber
fire.

